This ontology fragment defines three classes: `hpc:AssociationResponse`, `hpc:ClustersResponse`, and `hpc:ClustersRemovedResponse`. It also defines a single object property `hpc:hasContent` that has a domain of `hpc:AssociationResponse` and a range of `xsd:string`.
